{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "535adf99-8557-8687-91ca-fdc5c0403f60",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T13:29:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:26:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Kevin, good afternoon. Walter Peckham here. So I just got in from the morning run, I'm a substitute bus aide for the schools, so I do a couple of routes when they call me, and I was about to sit down with a sandwich when I looked out front and there it was again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There what was again, Walter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm drain in front of my house. Sorry, I get ahead of myself. It's grunting and slow, you can hear it gurgling, and every time we get a thaw it backs up into the street. Like today, it's been sunny, no storm, nothing, and there's a pond out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so dry weather, just the melt. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "306 Ocean Avenue, the Ocean Drive side. Not far from the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 306 Ocean Avenue. How deep does the water get out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About up to the hubcaps on my car. I measured it by the Corolla, honestly. And it sits there for hours. This keeps happening and nobody has done anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not great. Hubcap deep, backs up on any thaw. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask, is that a city drain or a state one? Because I've been going back and forth on that. Ocean Avenue feels like it could be either, and I don't want to keep calling the wrong people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. A lot of the roads out that way are city, but some are state-maintained, and I can't tell you for sure from the desk. I'll put it in as a drainage complaint and have the crew supervisor check whose it is. If it's state, we'll point them to the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. I just want somebody to actually come look at it. It's been like this every time the snow melts, and I'm tired of wading to my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is it blocking the road or just pooling along the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the curb and the lane next to it. Cars go through slow, and they throw water up on my [pause] hang on, sorry, that's my phone on the other line, it's probably the school. Can you hold one second?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'm back. They might call me in for an afternoon route, so if I cut out mid-sentence, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Let me read back what I have. 306 Ocean Avenue, Ocean Drive side, storm drain out front slow and backing up on thaws, water about hubcap deep, no storm involved, and you want to know whether it's city or state. Best number is 401-555-0186?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, that's the landline. If I'm not there leave a message, I'll call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Someone from the department should check it out and let you know whose drain it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I appreciate it, Kevin. Really, I just want it looked at before the next thaw, because there's more snow coming and it'll only get worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I've noted that. Take care, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
